## Production with Docker

### docker-compose

```bash
docker-compose up -d
```

- `backend/.env.production` → mounted as `/.env`  
- `backend/data` → persisted DB & Redis volume  

### Manual build & run

```bash
docker build -t {{formattedProjectName}}:latest .
docker run -d \
  --name {{formattedProjectName}} \
  -p 80:80 \
  -v $(pwd)/backend/.env.production:/.env:ro \
  -v $(pwd)/backend/data:/data \
  {{formattedProjectName}}:latest
```

